，主打运动中稳固不掉；下方标注产品名 “LIXIAOXIAO Eli Sport 2 Open-Ear Earbuds”。\n核心卖点卡片：用模块化卡片清晰展示优势：\n“S-Curve” 贴合设计（稳固舒适）；\n单耳仅 7.5g（超轻量化）；\n3 倍丰富音频细节 + Hi-Res 无线音频认证（音质优势）；\n单次 8 小时 / 总 45 小时续航、IP57 防汗防水、防误触物理按键（实用功能）。\n音质硬件详解：底部强调 “均衡有力的声音”，说明耳机搭载 17mm×12mm 钛涂层跑道型动圈单元，支撑 Hi-Res 标准与 3 倍音频细节，同时配耳机单元的特写图，突出硬件配置的科技感。\n整体版式通过 “运动场景 + 卖点卡片 + 硬件解析” 的组合，既传递了耳机在运动场景的适配性，也清晰展示了轻量化、长续航、优质音质等核心优势，精准契合运动爱好者的需求。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 13, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 14, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [505.30377197265625, 680.5096435546875], "pos": [2488.04150390625, 997.2315063476562], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 15, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [488.2784729003906, 289.92095947265625], "pos": [1207.9429931640625, 960.8883056640625], "widgets_values": ["This is a full-page advertisement for the furniture brand MØVI, featuring bold graphic design and vibrant product photography.\n\n**Top Half: Product Photography**\nThe upper portion of the ad showcases modern lounge seating arranged in a spacious, minimalist room.\n- **Furniture:** There are several modular or sectional sofas with rounded, sculptural forms. They come in three distinct, saturated colors:\n    - A bright orange sofa on the left side of the background.\n    - Two blue modules (one larger, one smaller) positioned centrally behind the coffee table.\n    - An orange-red sofa to the right, partially visible next to a glass-top coffee table.\n    The upholstery appears smooth and slightly glossy, possibly leatherette or vinyl.\n- **Coffee Table & Accessories:** In front of the red-orange sofa sits a contemporary two-tiered coffee table with a clear glass top and dark wood lower shelf, supported by slender chrome legs. On it rests a vase filled with colorful flowers (orange, yellow, purple), adding life to the scene.\n- **Setting & Ambiance:** The setting has clean lines, enhancing the modern aesthetic. It features light gray concrete flooring speckled with darker flecks, white horizontal blinds covering windows in the background, and large potted plants that add organic texture without overwhelming the space. The lighting is even and professional, highlighting the products' shapes and colors.\n\n**Bottom Half: Branding & Copy**\nA solid rust-colored banner occupies the bottom third of the page, containing all textual elements:\n\n*   **Logo/Graphic Element:** On the far left, there's an abstract logo composed of five overlapping white circles, creating a sense of interconnectedness or fluidity.\n*   **Headline Text:** To the right of the logo, in a crisp white sans-serif font, reads the tagline:\n    > ELEVATE YOUR SPACE, REDEFINE YOUR STYLE\n    >\n    > —ONLY AT MØVI\n\n*   **Body Copy:** Below the headline, more descriptive text explains their value proposition:\n    > Whether you're creating a cozy retreat or a sophisticated gathering space, our curated pieces bring personality and style to any room.\n\n*   **Call-to-Action / Website:** Beneath the body copy, the website address is provided in uppercase letters:\n    > WWW.MOVIFURNITURE.COM\n\n*   **Brand Name:** Dominating the very bottom center is the brand name \"MØVI\" in massive, bold, cream-white capital letters. The 'O' is stylized as a circle with a vertical line through its middle, reinforcing the visual motif from the circular logo above.\n\nOverall, the advertisement uses high-quality imagery combined with strong typography and color blocking to convey a message of stylish, customizable, and impactful home furnishings available exclusively at MØVI. The use of primary-like colors against neutral backgrounds makes the furniture pop and feels energetic and inviting."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 16, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [11], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [270.3683166503906, 355.5994873046875], "pos": [1451.98046875, 1316.8765869140625], "widgets_values": [683187181284474, "randomize", 10, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 17, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 18, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "正面条件"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 19, "label": "负面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "负面条件"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 20, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "随机种"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "步数"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "CFG"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "采样器"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "调度器"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "降噪"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "KSampler", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "order": 9}, {"m